Package: nfldoinkeR
Title: Load NFL Doink Data from Off the Upright
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mathew", "McKelvey", , "contact@offtheupright.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Loads the 'Off the Upright' database of NFL doinks (kicks that
    hit a goalpost or crossbar), together with kicker and team profile
    tables, from the data releases published at
    <https://github.com/ke1v3y/nfldoinkeR-data>. Tables are read through
    'nflreadr' and carry 'nflverse' game ids and 'GSIS' player ids so that
    they can be joined to 'nflverse' schedules and players. The data are
    licensed CC-BY-4.0; the package code is MIT.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ke1v3y/nfldoinkeR
BugReports: https://github.com/ke1v3y/nfldoinkeR/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    nflreadr (>= 1.4.0),
    rlang (>= 1.0.0)
Suggests:
